1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:11,481
Open the standalone Autoinstall USB Creator GUI, select a removable 64 GiB USB drive, and verify auto-detected ISO and offline bundle paths.

2
00:00:11,521 --> 00:00:25,569
Set server hostname, admin password, and LUKS2 disk encryption, type ERASE-USB to unlock, and build the verified bootable USB.

3
00:00:25,719 --> 00:00:36,319
Run --list-drives in the terminal to verify internal NVMe OS and OSCAR_BACKUP drives remain protected before launching TUI or CLI.

4
00:00:36,359 --> 00:01:04,305
Execute the non-interactive CLI with --password-file, LUKS2, --require-sudo-password, and --ssh-keys-only to stage CIDATA and OSCAR_MEDIA.
